void send_restock(bplid pid, plid from) ->
<strong><var>from</var> is ignored</strong>.
Sets the receiving player's reserve ammo to a version-defined value (see send_spawn_player()), HP to 100, blocks to 50, and grenades to 3. Usually plays a sound.

void send_connected_players(bplid pid) ->
For each player in PID_BROADCAST, calls send_existing_player() with <var>pid</var> as argument <var>pid</var> and the iterated player as <var>from</var> and if needed, send_move_input(), send_mouse_input() and send_kill().

